{"toolCallId":"call_1564aaaff48541b1bbbf9eed1f5c8245","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"check-ac-closure.sh\ncheck-ac-coverage.sh\ncheck-ai-protocols.sh\ncheck-canonical-save-description-graph-freshness.cjs\ncheck-canonical-save-description-graph-freshness.sh\ncheck-canonical-save-lineage.cjs\ncheck-canonical-save-lineage.sh\ncheck-canonical-save-packet-identity.cjs\ncheck-canonical-save-packet-identity.sh\ncheck-canonical-save-root-spec.cjs\ncheck-canonical-save-root-spec.sh\ncheck-canonical-save-shared.cjs\ncheck-canonical-save-source-docs.cjs\ncheck-canonical-save-source-docs.sh\ncheck-comment-hygiene.sh\ncheck-complexity.sh\ncheck-description-shape.sh\ncheck-files.sh\ncheck-folder-naming.sh\ncheck-frontmatter-values-helper.cjs\ncheck-frontmatter-values.sh\ncheck-frontmatter.sh\ncheck-graph-metadata-child-drift.sh\ncheck-graph-metadata-child-identity.sh\ncheck-graph-metadata-shape.sh\ncheck-graph-metadata.sh\ncheck-grep-convention-helper.mjs\ncheck-grep-convention.sh\ncheck-level-match.sh\ncheck-level.sh\ncheck-links.sh\ncheck-metadata-disk-consistency-helper.cjs\ncheck-metadata-disk-consistency.sh\ncheck-normalizer-lint.sh\ncheck-placeholders.sh\ncheck-scaffold-never-touched.sh\ncheck-source-tags-helper.mjs\ncheck-source-tags.sh\ncheck-spec-doc-integrity.sh\ncheck-status-cross-doc-consistency.sh\ncheck-template-source.sh\ncheck-toc-policy.sh\nREADME.md\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w1eb206b128/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"73f712","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
