{"toolCallId":"call_2c10d2a39faa43c79f50513138ce49d5","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"24:## 1. SUMMARY\n43:## 2. QUALITY GATES\n65:## 3. ARCHITECTURE\n125:## 4. IMPLEMENTATION PHASES\n167:## 5. TESTING STRATEGY\n181:## 6. DEPENDENCIES\n196:## 7. ROLLBACK PLAN\n206:## L2: PHASE DEPENDENCIES\n228:## L2: EFFORT ESTIMATION\n245:## L2: ENHANCED ROLLBACK\n268:## L3: DEPENDENCY GRAPH\n323:## L3: CRITICAL PATH\n343:## L3: MILESTONES\n357:## L3: ARCHITECTURE DECISION SUMMARY\n=== TASKS ===\n23:## Task Notation\n38:## Milestone Reference\n52:## Phase 1: Setup [Milestone M1]\n54:- [x] T001 Create auth directory structure (`src/auth/`) [15m]\n55:- [x] T002 Install bcrypt, jsonwebtoken, express-validator (`package.json`) [10m]\n56:- [x] T003 [P] Configure environment variables (`env.example`, `.env`) [15m]\n57:- [x] T004 [P] Add User model to Prisma schema (`prisma/schema.prisma`) [20m]\n64:## Phase 2: Database [Milestone M1]\n66:- [x] T005 Run Prisma migration (`prisma/migrations/`) [15m] {deps: T004}\n67:- [x] T006 Add unique index on email (`prisma/schema.prisma`) [10m] {deps: T005}\n74:## Phase 3: Core Services [Milestone M2]\n77:- [x] T007 Implement hashPassword function (`src/utils/hash.js`) [30m] {deps: T002}\n78:- [x] T008 Implement verifyPassword function (`src/utils/hash.js`) [20m] {deps: T007}\n81:- [x] T009 [P] Implement generateToken function (`src/utils/token.js`) [30m] {deps: T002}\n82:- [x] T010 [P] Implement verifyToken function (`src/utils/token.js`) [30m] {deps: T009}\n85:- [x] T011 [P] Create registration validator (`src/validators/auth.js`) [30m] {deps: T002}\n86:- [x] T012 [P] Create login validator (`src/validators/auth.js`) [20m] {deps: T011}\n93:## Phase 4: API Endpoints [Milestone M3]\n96:- [x] T013 Create registration route handler (`src/auth/register.js`) [45m] {deps: T007, T011}\n97:- [x] T014 Add user creation with hashed password (`src/auth/register.js`) [30m] {deps: T013}\n98:- [x] T015 Add duplicate email check (`src/auth/register.js`) [20m] {deps: T014}\n101:- [x] T016 Create login route handler (`src/auth/login.js`) [30m] {deps: T008, T009, T012}\n102:- [x] T017 Add password verification (`src/auth/login.js`) [20m] {deps: T016}\n103:- [x] T018 Add token generation on success (`src/auth/login.js`) [20m] {deps: T017}\n106:- [x] T019 Create logout route handler (`src/auth/logout.js`) [20m] {deps: T010}\n109:- [x] T020 Create auth middleware (`src/middleware/auth.js`) [45m] {deps: T010}\n110:- [x] T021 Add protected route example (`src/routes/dashboard.js`) [15m] {deps: T020}\n113:- [x] T022 Wire up all routes in app.js (`app.js`) [20m] {deps: T015, T018, T019, T020}\n120:## Phase 5: UI [Milestone M4]\n122:- [x] T023 Create registration form view (`views/auth/register.ejs`) [30m] {deps: T015}\n123:- [x] T024 Create login form view (`views/auth/login.ejs`) [30m] {deps: T018}\n124:- [x] T025 [P] Add client-side token storage (`public/js/auth.js`) [30m] {deps: T018}\n125:- [x] T026 [P] Add error message styling (`public/css/auth.css`) [20m]\n126:- [x] T027 [P] Add success feedback styling (`public/css/auth.css`) [15m]\n127:- [x] T028 Add logout button to nav (`views/partials/nav.ejs`) [15m] {deps: T019}\n134:## Phase 6: Verification [Milestone M5]\n137:- [x] T029 Test hashPassword function (`tests/unit/hash.test.js`) [20m] {deps: T008}\n138:- [x] T030 Test verifyPassword function (`tests/unit/hash.test.js`) [15m] {deps: T029}\n139:- [x] T031 [P] Test generateToken function (`tests/unit/token.test.js`) [15m] {deps: T010}\n140:- [x] T032 [P] Test verifyToken function (`tests/unit/token.test.js`) [15m] {deps: T031}\n141:- [x] T033 [P] Test validation schemas (`tests/unit/auth-validator.test.js`) [30m] {deps: T012}\n144:- [x] T034 Test registration - success case (`tests/integration/auth.test.js`) [20m] {deps: T022}\n145:- [x] T035 Test registration - duplicate email (`tests/integration/auth.test.js`) [15m] {deps: T034}\n146:- [x] T036 Test registration - invalid input (`tests/integration/auth.test.js`) [15m] {deps: T034}\n147:- [x] T037 Test login - success case (`tests/integration/auth.test.js`) [20m] {deps: T034}\n148:- [x] T038 Test login - invalid credentials (`tests/integration/auth.test.js`) [15m] {deps: T037}\n149:- [x] T039 Test protected route - with token (`tests/integration/auth.test.js`) [15m] {deps: T037}\n150:- [x] T040 Test protected route - without token (`tests/integration/auth.test.js`) [10m] {deps: T039}\n153:- [x] T041 Test full user journey in Chrome [30m] {deps: T028}\n154:- [x] T042 Test full user journey in Firefox [20m] {deps: T041}\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w1eb206b128/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"e3b5d1","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
